'''Gabdorins''' were a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] of large, round-headed [[amphibian]]s from [[Gabdor]]<ref name="CGSWG" />. 

==Biology and appearance==
Gabdorins have ridged nostrils and massive [[sweat gland]]s. 

==Gabdorins in the galaxy==
[[Quiggold]], a [[Gender|male]] member of [[Sidon Ithano]]'s [[Sidon Ithano's pirate crew|crew]], was a Gabdorin.<ref name="Lost Treasure" /> [[Darrb]] was a Gabdorin [[fruit]] [[Merchant|vendor]] on the [[planet]] [[Varkana]].<ref name="The Missing Agent">{{Resistance|The Missing Agent}}</ref> [[Krynodd]] was a Gabdorin male criminal who lived on the [[desert]] [[planet]] [[Jakku]].<ref name="Choose Your Destiny: A Scavenger Mission">''[[Choose Your Destiny: A Scavenger Mission]]''</ref>

